    "pty_test_wiring": "tests/core_compat_extra.rs:13-34 includes tests/core_compat_extra/pty.rs; Cargo.toml:157-165 declares core_compat_extra. The new applet invocation should use xsh core/btop.xsh -- ARGS.",
    "monotonic_clock": "No public monotonic clock exists. time.now is wall-clock only, crates/xsh-registry/src/signature/docs.rs:1528-1531; G1 needs the smallest registry-backed monotonic API."
